      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate reported a total prior year release of $3.3 million USD, comprising a $2.7 million profit on the 2015 and prior years of account and a $0.6 million profit on the 2016 year of account. This favorable development was influenced by various factors, including the management of exposure to the Ghanaian Jubilee oil field loss in 2016. Prior period restatements for 2016 included a $1.0 million overstatement in energy construction claim liabilities (a release), a $0.6 million understatement of profit commission payable on aviation contracts (a strengthening), and a $0.5 million understatement of gross written premium (a release).",
